<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="c82c5a14">&lt;p&gt;
    Create the agenda and presentation materials needed to facilitate the Oracle trusted workshops with key client
    stakeholders and schedule the sessions. Workshops can focus on specific topics such as:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Risk and internal controls
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Application and data security
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        User identity and governance
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Evolving risk management
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;</attribute>
